        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>swaps the points b and c together with their ids, which selects the mirror sphere as in the
base class, and gives exactly the state of reset( a, c, b, rSq );
this hides the id-less flip of the base class, which would leave stale ids
</verbatim> </para>
